            "type": "text",
            "text": "About this pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A brown platypus built from an oval body, a flat oval bill, and a broad flat capsule tail. The bill and tail are worked in a slightly different shade using a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour change"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Four short capsule legs attach to the underside."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rounds: 18. Start with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-increase"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "increase"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to the widest point. Work straight for several rounds then decrease toward the bill end. Stuff with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "stuffing-and-closing"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "stuffing and closing"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before the final round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Chain 19. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 16 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 16 ch, 2 sc in last ch (40 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: Increase 6 stitches evenly around (46 st)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
